Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:14.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Day 478 on chogos.vercel.app. Sixty founding citizens. The clock is live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:22.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six completed road spurs. No critical shortage. The map's storehouse is\Nlabeled simulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:28.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Workshop E is an AI decision.\NThe sentence under it is the model's own reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:34.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The column beside it says Simulation.\NA simulated food batch is not a balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:42.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Token 104 is CHOG #1565.\NownerOf on this request is 0xEf6f…577F.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:50.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,No AI decision is stored for this citizen. These shifts are simulation. The\Nrecord stays with the token.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:56.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,History, filtered to AI.\NThese construction rows are stored model decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:02.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Workshop E, House 18, and South Meadows Plot.\NEach line keeps the reason the model gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The browser recomputes the hash.\NThis page says the event is not a blockchain transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:18.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Source AI. Chain status offchain. Both hashes start 0xe15a85e8. No Merkle\Nbatch, and no anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:40.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,ChogBank is not deployed. No funding address. This server does not sign or\Nbroadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:48.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,MON and $CHOG were not read. These limits are application rules, not a live\Ncontract. $CHOG is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Watcher rows for Genesis transfers.\NThe row we checked is token 1021, block 113457077.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:14.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The page says the application has not independently verified this transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:18.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Token 1021 moved in block 113457077. The hash chain matches. This is not an\Nonchain anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:22.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Receipt check: not read. Hash 0x8f97aafb…02c4536b. Log 82. Token 1021.
